or trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization:</strong> Customize your hero and unlock more cosmetics through in game progression only!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ascension Difficulty:</strong> Challenge yourself with 10 difficulty modifiers upon first completing the game. Gradually unlocking these.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Little Adventure Tale Comes with:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cards:</strong> 280 cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trinkets:</strong> 78</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Events:</strong> 12</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Companion Classes:</strong> 6</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player Classes:</strong> 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Potions:</strong> 33</p></li></ul>",
